## Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/
# Package.resolved is committed on purpose: it pins onnxruntime and friends
# to exact versions so model-runtime behaviour is reproducible across machines.

## Playgrounds
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

# ─── CocoaPods ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pods/ is intentionally NOT ignored — see
# https://guides.cocoapods.org/using/using-cocoapods.html#should-i-check-the-pods-directory-into-source-control
# But the ONNX Runtime pod ships a large xcframework; if it lands in Pods/,
# reconsider and vendor it via SPM instead.

